 R←Test_Dir2_017(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list
⍝ Test the `Dir2` method on complex wildcard expressions
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 list←##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2'Tests\Test Dir\*.?o?'
 →T.PassesIf 1=≢list
 →T.PassesIf 1=≢¨list

 list←('recurse' 1)##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2'Tests\Test Dir\*.?o?'
 →T.PassesIf 1=≢list
 →T.PassesIf 6=≢¨list

 list←('recurse' 1)('type'(5 2 1 0))##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2'Tests\Test Dir\*.?o?'
 →T.PassesIf 4=≢list
 →T.PassesIf 6 6 6 6≡≢¨list

